'#C00000'&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; = fails closed on loss of air/signal, &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#007A33'&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; = fails open. Tags: FCV flow, PCV pressure, LCV level, TCV temperature.&lt;br&gt;Utilities: &lt;font color='#A93226'&gt;steam (HPS 41 bar/254 °C, LPS 5 barg/160 °C)&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color='#1F618D'&gt;cooling water 30 → 40 °C&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color='#117A65'&gt;boiler feed water&lt;/font&gt;. Diamonds = stream numbers. Blue text = operating conditions (design basis, see notes)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="86" y="1106" width="940" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tb_131" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;STREAM TABLE (design basis - verify by process simulation)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10px;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;#&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Stream&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;T (°C)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;P (bar)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Phase&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Main components&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Remark&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CO2 feed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;25&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CO2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Battery-limit supply (assumed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2 feed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;25&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;30&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PEM-electrolyser supply (assumed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Mixed reactor feed (MX-101 out)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;60&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2, CO2 (≈ 3:1 fresh), CO, trace CH3OH&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Feeds at 40 / 90 / 60 °C mixed; then heated to 230 °C in E-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Reactor effluent (R-101 out)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;250&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;48.5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2, CO2, CH3OH, H2O, CO&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Reactor ΔP ≈ 1 bar&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;V-101 overhead (recycle + purge)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2, CO2, CO&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-102 outlet 45 °C with CW (&gt; 40 °C, no refrigeration)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Recycle gas (K-103 out)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;60&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;51&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2, CO2, CO&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Back to 51 bar = feed compressor discharge&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Crude methanol (V-101 bottoms)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Liquid&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CH3OH, H2O, dissolved CO2/H2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;LCV-101 lets down to ≈ 2 bar&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;T-101 overhead vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;69&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1.2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CH3OH&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Bubble/dew point of CH3OH at 1.2 bar&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;T-101 bottoms&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;111&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1.5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Liquid&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2O (+ trace CH3OH)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Boiling point of water at 1.5 bar&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1215" width="1020" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tb_132" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;CONTROL VALVE SCHEDULE (fail-safe positions)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10px;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Tag&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Service&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Fail&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Reason&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CO2 feed to K-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Stop feeding reactants to the loop on air/signal failure; avoids unreacted CO2/H2 accumulating.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2 feed to K-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Same as above; also keeps H2:CO2 ratio controller (3:1) safe - both feeds close together.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PCV-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Reactor loop → V-101 (48 → 45 bar)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Loop pressure control; fail open so the reactor loop cannot be over-pressured by a closed valve.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-103&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Purge from V-101 gas&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Keeps H2 / flammable gas inside; loop over-pressure is covered by PSV (not shown on PFD).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;LCV-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;V-101 liquid → distillation (45 → 2 bar)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Prevents high-pressure gas blow-through into the low-pressure column system.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-104&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;T-101 feed (3.0 → 1.4 bar)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Stops feeding the column when control is lost; avoids flooding.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-105&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;T-101 reflux&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Reflux continues to keep overhead temperature/pressure from rising.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-106&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Methanol product&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Closes to keep inventory in the column; reflux (FO) takes the whole condensate.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;LCV-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;T-101 bottoms water&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Maintains the column sump level; prevents P-103 running dry / vapour blow-by.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-101 HPS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Loss of control must not overheat the catalyst feed (&gt; 250 °C: sintering of Cu catalyst).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;R-101 BFW (cooling)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Exothermic reactor: cooling must be maximum on failure to avoid temperature runaway.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-103&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-102 cooling water&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Loss of cooling must not leave hot gas going to V-101.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-104&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-103 LPS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Heater: stop heating on failure.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-105&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-104 cooling water&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Loss of condensation would over-pressure T-101.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-106&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-105 LPS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Reboiler: stop heating on failure (prevent column over-pressure / flooding).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="1100" width="1190" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b style='font-size:12px;'&gt;DESIGN BASIS / WHY THESE CONDITIONS (Chapter 5 heuristics + literature)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Heuristics used (Ch.5):&lt;/b&gt; prefer 1 &amp;lt; P &amp;lt; 10 bar and 40 &amp;lt; T &amp;lt; 260 °C; T &amp;gt; 250 °C needs HPS/fired heater, T &amp;gt; 400 °C special MoC, T &amp;lt; 40 °C needs refrigeration (use cooling water 30 → 40 °C as much as possible); P &amp;gt; 10 bar needs thick walls, compressors; compressor with Pout/Pin &amp;gt; 3 → multistage + intercoolers; ΔTlm &amp;gt; 100 °C → heat integration; large ΔP valves are acceptable for control / liquid throttling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;R-101 (250 °C, 50 bar) = condition of special concern (high pressure):&lt;/b&gt; CO2 + 3H2 → CH3OH + H2O (4 → 2 mol, exothermic ≈ -49.5 kJ/mol). High pressure raises equilibrium conversion and rate (Table 6.2); low T favours equilibrium but the Cu/ZnO/Al2O3 catalyst needs about 200-300 °C for useful rate. 250 °C stays below 260 °C (HPS 254 °C is enough, no fired heater) and well below 400 °C (carbon / low-alloy steel, check H2 attack - Nelson curve). Penalty: thick walls, 51 bar feed compression. Recycle + purge needed because of low per-pass conversion and inerts/CO.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;K-101:&lt;/b&gt; ratio 51 &amp;gt; 3 → 4 stages (r ≈ 2.7 each) with intercoolers (shown as one package).  &lt;b&gt;K-102:&lt;/b&gt; ratio 1.7 &amp;lt; 3 → one stage.  &lt;b&gt;K-103:&lt;/b&gt; ratio 1.13.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;E-102 / V-101:&lt;/b&gt; cooled to 45 °C with cooling water (no refrigeration, still &amp;gt; 40 °C) so CH3OH/H2O condense; vapor loss of CH3OH at 45 °C / 45 bar is small.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;T-101:&lt;/b&gt; 1.2-1.5 bar (inside 1-10 bar, no vacuum, no thick wall); overhead 69 °C condensed with cooling water, bottoms 111 °C reboiled with LPS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;References:&lt;/b&gt; (1) CPE604 Chapter 5 lecture notes (Turton et al., Analysis, Synthesis and Design of Chemical Processes, 4th ed., Ch.6). (2) Van-Dal and Bouallou, J. Cleaner Production 57 (2013) 38-45 (CO2-to-methanol plant, Cu/ZnO/Al2O3). (3) Experimental Cu/ZnO/Al2O3 work: 200-230 °C, 50-80 bar (UCM, Experimental PSA reactor for methanol-enhanced production via CO2 hydrogenation). (4) US patent 9,133,074: reaction 150-300 °C, preferably 200-300 °C. Utility levels: HPS 40-50 bar at 250-265 °C and cooling water 30/40 °C from the lecture notes; LPS 5 barg/160 °C typical (Turton Table 8.3).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#C00000'&gt;&lt;b&gt;All numeric values are design assumptions to be confirmed with a simulation (Aspen/DWSIM) and the unit-ops sizing.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#888888;spacing=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1425" width="1020" height="235" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ed_18" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#000000;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="src_co2" target="s1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed_19" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=none;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#000000;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.7000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s1" target="fcv101"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed_20" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#000000;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.7000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="fcv101" target="k101"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed_21" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=none;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#000000;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="k101" target="jf"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="370" y="410"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed_22" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#000000;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="src_h2" target="s2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed_23" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=none;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#000000;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.7000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="fcv102"